  "correct": "2",
  "solution": "Given equation: 26 ÷ 2 + 13 × 6 − 4 = 10.\n\nBODMAS Table: \n\n [IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/d50192f098c21078501d30eeafe1a8c64bc30dd9621c48caa8a39ffc60f68b64.png] \n\nLet's check each option one by one.\n\nOption 1) 13 and 4\n\nGiven: 26 ÷ 2 + 13 × 6 − 4 = 10\n\nAfter interchanging the numbers we get;\n\n⇒ __**26 ÷ 2**__ + 4 × 6 − 13 = 10\n\n⇒ 13 + __**4**____** × 6**__ − 13 = 10\n\n⇒ __**13 + 24**__ − 13 = 10\n\n⇒ __**37 − 13**__ = 10\n\n⇒ 24 ≠ 10\n\n⇒ LHS ≠ RHS\n\n**Option 2)** **2 and 13**\n\nGiven: 26 ÷ 2 + 13 × 6 − 4 = 10\n\nAfter interchanging the numbers we get;\n\n⇒ __**26 ÷ 13**__ + 2 × 6 − 4 = 10\n\n⇒ 2 + __**2**____** × 6**__ − 4 = 10\n\n⇒ __**2**____** + 12**__ − 4 = 10\n\n⇒ __14____ – 4__ = 10\n\n⇒ **10 = 10**\n\n**⇒ LHS = RHS**\n\nOption 3) 2 and 10\n\nGiven: 26 ÷ 2 + 13 × 6 − 4 = 10\n\nAfter interchanging the numbers we get;\n\n⇒ __**26 ÷ 10**__ + 13 × 6 − 4 = 2\n\n⇒ 2.6 + __**13 × 6**__ − 4 = 2\n\n⇒ __**2.6 + 78**__ − 4 = 2\n\n⇒ __**80.6 − 4**__ = 2\n\n⇒ 76.6 ≠ 2\n\n⇒ LHS ≠ RHS\n\nOption 4) 2 and 4\n\nGiven: 26 ÷ 2 + 13 × 6 − 4 = 10\n\nAfter interchanging the numbers we get;\n\n⇒ __**26 ÷ 4**__ + 13 × 6 − 2 = 10\n\n⇒ 6.5 + __**13 × 6**__ − 2 = 10\n\n⇒ __**6.5 **____**+ 78**__ − 2 = 10\n\n⇒ __84.5 - 2__ = 10\n\n⇒ 82.5 ≠ 10\n\n⇒ LHS ≠ RHS\n\nHence, the correct answer is \"Option 2\".",
